{
  "$comment": [
    "The Averlo ports (research R3; the procedure is process/workflows.md, 'Port the design system').",
    "scripts/port-averlo.mjs copies each entry with its whole import closure from <PORT_SOURCES_DIR>/<repo> at <commit>, unchanged, to the same path relative to src/ under targetRoot, and records it in scripts/ports.lock.json and docs/design-source.md.",
    "exclude: files never copied even when the closure reaches them (licence forbids redistribution). templateOwned: paths a port may never write.",
    "driftTest: false turns off npm run check:ports (for a deck that changes its ports)."
  ],
  "driftTest": true,
  "templateOwned": [
    "src/app/",
    "src/deck/",
    "src/gate/",
    "src/boot/",
    "src/motion/",
    "src/brand/",
    "src/components/deck/",
    "src/slides/",
    "src/styles/",
    "src/_origin-temp/"
  ],
